This repository includes third-party material:

- models/franka_emika_panda/: Franka Emika Panda model from MuJoCo Menagerie
  (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie), Apache License 2.0,
  see models/franka_emika_panda/LICENSE. The cube scenes in that folder
  (cube_lift_scene.xml, multi_cube_scene.xml) are this project's.
- scripts/controller.py follows patterns from kevinzakka/mjctrl
  (https://github.com/kevinzakka/mjctrl, commit f1c82c2); no code is vendored.

The LIBERO harness (harness/, libero/) runs on LeRobot
(https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot, Apache License 2.0) and LIBERO
(https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO), installed separately.
